<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWISS OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWISS OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GSTAAD, Switzerland 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results</p>
<p>from the Swiss Open on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat 1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Richey Reneberg (U.S.) beat 5-Albert Costa (Spain) 6-2 1-6 6-4</p>
<p>3-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Pat Cash (Australia) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Bertrand Madsen (Haiti) 3-6 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>4-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Jaime Oncins (Brazil) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>2-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) 6-3</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) beat Ivo Heuberger (Switzerland) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Fernando Vicente (Spain) beat Karim Alami (Morocco) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Galo Blanco (Spain) beat Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>7-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Daniel Vacek (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Renzo Furlan (Italy) beat Marc Kevin Goellner (Germany) 5-7 6-</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Cedric Pioline (France) beat Fabrice Santoro (France) 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) beat Thierry Champion (France) 2-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-0) 6-4</p>
</text>
